              "message": "Resource '/subscriptions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resourceGroups/example-rg/providers/Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines/web-vm-02' is not attached to scheduled action 'weekday-start'."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
